Origin: EmberBSD, AI-assisted.
EmberBSD keeps one Berkeley DB, db18. These packages included
databases/db4 or db5 directly, or accepted only db2..db5:
- trustedQSL 2.8 stores its data in SQLite (find_package(SQLite3)), not
  Berkeley DB: depend on sqlite3 and drop the db5 dependency.
- opensmtpd, jigdo (gtk), libpinyin and clisp-bdb use databases/db18.
- libtabe and xcin accept db18 (patch-ae/af already use the 4.3+ stat).
- cstore accepts db18.
Not submitted upstream.

--- a/databases/clisp-bdb/Makefile
+++ b/databases/clisp-bdb/Makefile
